                  "notes": "molecular_formula '2Cl.Co' -> '2Cl.Co.2H2O'. The recorded value described the anhydrous salt while the label names a hydrate, understating the mass by 18 g/mol per water. Corrected because the label states 2 water(s) of hydration, and the recorded formula was byte-identical to the anhydrous parent CHEBI:35696's ChEBI formula ('2Cl.Co') — the mark of a value inherited from the parent rather than measured for this record. Water appended in ChEBI's own dot-separated notation.",
